<h2 id="_ansible_automation_platform_on_aws_open_environment">Ansible Automation Platform on AWS - Open Environment</h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="_welcome_to_the_red_hat_ansible_automation_platform_on_amazon_aws_rhpds">Welcome to the Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform on Amazon AWS RHPDS</h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>This environment provides Red Hatters with on-demand access to an AWS environment, including the Ansible Automation Platform on AWS service offering. This time-bound sandbox allows you to experience the Ansible Automation Platform on AWS. As a Red Hat associate, you will be enabled to test, create, and demo this offering, helping our customers and account teams succeed. This AWS sandbox will allow users to do things not previously offered.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Always remember, **"With Great Power, Comes Great Responsibility."**</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>**Note:** By ordering this sandbox, the user takes full responsibility for their environment, including:</p>
</div>
<div class="ulist">
<ul>
<li>
<p>The costs of services ordered</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The security of any credentials provided</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Approval and permission for usage</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Reporting of any issues or anomalies due to usage</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Adherence to Red Hat Compliance and Ethics Policies</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>This is for **INTERNAL use only** and not to be shared with customers or partners</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Current Offering:</p>
</div>
<div class="ulist">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform on AWS. (You will deploy AAP from the AWS Marketplace in the AWS account provided.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Provisioning Time (for the AWS environment):</p>
</div>
<div class="ulist">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Approximately 30 minutes</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Once you are in the AWS environment, it will take about 60 minutes to deploy AAP on AWS from the AWS Marketplace. The guide listed below provides instructions on how to perform this deployment.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Default Lifespan of Environment:</p>
</div>
<div class="ulist">
<ul>
<li>
<p>2 Days</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Extensions Available: YES</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Demo Guide:</p>
</div>
<div class="ulist">
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1K5eY2dSIJKe8F5IVhhX0E-H_xuNnPHiJzn_hnJz8Vpw/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1K5eY2dSIJKe8F5IVhhX0E-H_xuNnPHiJzn_hnJz8Vpw/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>
