<div class="paragraph">
<p>Due to changes in Red Hat's Cost Center membership, some associates are experiencing issues accessing open environments. Please open a ticket at <a href="https://red.ht/rhpds-help" target="_blank">https://red.ht/rhpds-help</a> if you encounter problems.</p>
</div>
